WEBVTT

00:02:58.621 --> 00:03:02.288
and thousands of election officials
about the process.

00:03:02.996 --> 00:03:06.163
I also coauthored a book
called "When Women Vote,"

00:03:06.163 --> 00:03:08.996
that outlines a road map and a playbook

00:03:09.038 --> 00:03:11.746
for how to improve the process for all.

00:03:11.788 --> 00:03:13.413
And so I ask you:

00:03:13.454 --> 00:03:14.954
What would you choose?

00:03:14.954 --> 00:03:17.246
Which scenario would you choose?

00:03:17.788 --> 00:03:21.538
Now, the 2016 election
was the most highly watched,

00:03:21.579 --> 00:03:24.454
most anticipated election in US history.

00:03:26.121 --> 00:03:27.288
And yet,

00:03:27.288 --> 00:03:31.621
only 60 percent of eligible Americans
actually voted.